config MCUBOOT_INDICATOR
	bool "FoBE MCUboot status indicator"
	depends on MCUBOOT
	depends on MCUBOOT_ACTION_HOOKS
	depends on GPIO
	help
	  Enable FoBE bootloader status indication hooks for MCUboot.

	  The current implementation uses the mcuboot-led0 devicetree alias for
	  recovery status and wraps serial console read/write calls to show
	  recovery traffic activity.
